### Language Learning Platform API Tests
### Install REST Client extension in VS Code: es-asia.rest-client
### Then click "Send Request" above each section

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@email = admin@languageapp.com
@password = password123
@token = 

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

### Login (REQUIRED - Copy token from response to @token variable above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "bio": "I'm learning languages!"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 2. COURSES
### ============================================

### List all courses (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses

### Get single course (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1

### Create a course (instructor only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "German for Beginners",
  "language": "German",
  "level": "beginner",
  "description": "Learn German from scratch"
}

### Update course
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Course Title",
  "level": "intermediate"
}

### Delete course
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enroll in a course
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my enrollments
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get course progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 3. LESSONS
### ============================================

### Get lessons for a course
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/lessons

### Get single lesson
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1

### Create lesson (instructor only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "course_id": 1,
  "title": "Greetings",
  "order": 1,
  "duration_minutes": 30,
  "video_url": "https://example.com/video.mp4"
}

### Update lesson
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Lesson Title",
  "duration_minutes": 45
}

### Mark lesson as complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get lesson progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update lesson progress
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "progress_percentage": 75
}

### ============================================
### 4. EXERCISES
### ============================================

### Get exercises for a lesson
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/1/exercises

### Get single exercise
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1

### Create exercise (instructor only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "lesson_id": 1,
  "exercise_type": "listening",
  "content": "Listen to the audio and repeat",
  "points": 10
}

### Submit exercise
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "submission_content": "Guten Tag"
}

### Get my submission
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1/my-submission
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get all submissions (instructor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Grade submission (instructor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercise-submissions/1/grade
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "score": 8,
  "feedback": "Good pronunciation!"
}

### Get exercise statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 5. QUIZZES
### ============================================

### Get quizzes for a course
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/quizzes

### Get single quiz
GET {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/1

### Create quiz (instructor only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quizzes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "course_id": 1,
  "title": "Spanish Basics Assessment",
  "passing_score": 70,
  "time_limit_minutes": 30
}

### Add question to quiz (instructor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question_type": "multiple_choice",
  "question_text": "What is 2+2?",
  "options": ["3", "4", "5", "6"],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "points": 10
}

### Submit quiz
POST {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "answers": {
    "1": "4",
    "2": "true",
    "3": "Paris"
  }
}

### Get quiz results
GET {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/1/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get quiz statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/quizzes/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. PROGRESS & ANALYTICS
### ============================================

### Get user dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get detailed course progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get lesson progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get quiz attempt history
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/quiz-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get performance report
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
